From: genkigenki <3080081+genkigenki@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 21:09:53 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Tools: add the approved LCD clip colour table and its
 calculator

tools/apc_pad_colors.py adds the OKLCH lift model for the LCD clip colours.
The model keeps the hue and lifts the luminance to Y >= 0.25 * (t/255)^2.2.
The strong hue fix applies only to 0x32 and 0x33.
The --c option writes the APC40_LCD565[128] table.
firmware/src/app/apc40_lcd565.h is the table that tools/apc_pad_colors.py --c made.
The owner approved this table (docs/USER_PREFERENCES.md).
No firmware file uses the table yet. Put it into the firmware after the Bluetooth test.
